<title>UK: Rabobank sets 2.0 bln Lux franc eight-year bond.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets 2.0 bln Lux franc eight-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers  BIL, BBL and Rabobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK</p>
<p> AMT    2.O BLN LUF   COUPON     5.50	MATURITY    08.JUL.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.50    PAY DATE    08.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    LUX	 YIELD	 5.11 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NETH	HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    =	   SELL CONC  1.75	PRAECIPUUM  0.25</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
